<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-09T00:11:50.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-8ee89efb-9d8c-4e10-9d4c-1cbf60420e9c",
        "text": "Wow! You've come so far! You started by building the *frame* of Fayea's website using HTML, creating the title, heading, paragraph, and image.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4f2f383cc29f7db15ad5a18d831163df-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-1-179dcbfb-96b4-4ca7-8cc9-abf26e01df50.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-87535ec0-71e1-4617-89cb-69947dbdd62f",
        "text": "Then, you learned how to add colorful *style* with CSS, making Fayea's Dojo website look vibrant and inviting with new colors!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/edca9d040eb10bacf9a0334819e72440-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-2-06d77f6e-093c-4b0b-8fdd-e8274b938524.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-e7649b53-d967-491d-9806-c3b608218181",
        "text": "Look what you've created! A real, live webpage for Fayea's Self-Defense Lessons, ready to share with the world!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8d597b80a74501107df27786f9dbf923-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-3-94c12fca-3186-4a56-a371-ba0af7ae99f0.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-9e77e5fa-1bb9-4aa7-827a-1c6ffe3886bd",
        "text": "This is just the beginning! What if Fayea wants a page just for her sword lessons? You could add *links* to connect different pages!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6ab13463cbfc2b1b74d7d418c540b5e6-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-4-f221ff6c-be51-4567-a6af-574e3528a965.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-32173484-e8fc-4a73-ad3d-4b3970535906",
        "text": "Or maybe she needs more pictures of her cool moves, or even a video! There are so many ways to add exciting content to her site.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8757e6c0de9d231c2f1150f4f0392775-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-5-f9d2c497-fc36-4ff3-b290-a0a467473d41.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-lesson-summary-14fc5482-ee5a-4e32-83f3-66271c5cd4d8",
        "text": "You now have the power to build and decorate your own corners of the internet. Keep experimenting and creating amazing websites!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/32765325528450a8eee3d5a5b9e2f60f-agathaweb-lesson-summary-panel-6-85e7887d-ce3c-4859-b5ca-20ae7aa5d49f.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Summarize what the students have learned about building a simple website for Fayea using HTML and CSS. Celebrate their achievement and hint at what more they could add, like links to other pages or more pictures of Fayea's moves."
  },
